From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 04:44:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Bound attachment transfers by absolute elapsed
 deadline

Proof: real slow-header and slow-body tests fail before fix; bounded transport cancels sockets and rejects late connections. Focused HTTP, custody, sync-client and worker-node suites pass.
